 525          /*--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 526           * void ISR_Init(void)
 527           * Purpose : Initial the ISR Fifo Table
 528           * Params  : $ *p  => Address
 529           *           $ len => display length
 530           * Returns : None
 531           * Note    : The length can not large than 0xff
 532           *--------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
